{"type": "say", "text": "Hi everyone. The public API rate-limit project is up for its production policy review on August 25, and I'll be making the final decision on the policy that gets communicated to customers. Before I record anything, I need to hear from each of your teams — backend engineering, customer success, security, and support operations — on any release-impacting findings you have. The current draft allows 100 requests per minute for ordinary API keys, applies the same limit to authentication endpoints, and doesn't specify a staffed launch window. Please share your findings so we can work through this together."}
